This product is an add-on for SnapRef (https://github.com/ArcAnima/SnapRef),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It hooks into SnapRef's
self-attention patch at run time and follows SnapRef's approach of merging
attention groups by their log-sum-exp. SnapRef itself is not included.

The sample reference images in examples/input and the images in docs were
generated with an Anima-based model and are provided as examples only.
